n't be ready.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, I've got to make a meal too. John and Sandra are coming over. I've just gotta ask you some questions.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: OK.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le03ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: How much red wine should I put into a quart of tomato pasta sauce?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, not too much. 4 fluid ounces is plenty.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: My parents like espresso. How much coffee do I use?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Three-quarters of an ounce is enough for a single shot.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks. So what're you making?", "id": 2, "time": "17000", "image": "engenn6le03ob06re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, I'm making roasted chicken legs. My dad loves to grab those with his fingers. And grilled veggies, and tiramisu for dessert. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I used to have tiramisu a lot. Well, I need to plan my meal. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yup! And I'd better marinate the chicken before it goes in the oven. Good luck, Peter. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: You too, but I know you don't need any luck. Say hi to your family.", "id": 3, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn6le03ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le03ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le03ob06re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}